%% Render: ~/.zcode/tools/mermaid-render/render.sh -i one-copied-trade.mmd -o ../images/one-copied-trade.png -b white -s 2 -w 1600
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant L as Leader wallet
    participant W as Worker
    participant H as Helius
    participant J as Jupiter
    participant D as Dashboard

    L-->>H: a buy lands on chain
    W->>H: poll getTransactionsForAddress
    H-->>W: the transaction
    Note over W: classify and dedupe, drop events older than 90s<br/>size at 0.25x with caps<br/>risk gates on exposure, daily loss, price age
    W->>J: request a quote
    J-->>W: price and route
    alt paper mode
        W->>W: simulate the fill
    else live and armed
        W->>W: sign, submit, confirm
    end
    W->>D: position, fill, equity

    L-->>H: a sell lands on chain
    W->>H: poll
    H-->>W: the sell
    Note over W: sell the same fraction
    W->>D: close, PnL, loss streak
